# 58. UI Layout Recommendation

Suggested modal flow:

```text
────────────────────────────
AI GOAL ARCHITECT

User prompt / conversation

[chat messages]

Current Goal Preview
┌─────────────────────────┐
│ Flutter Mastery         │
│ ...                     │
│                         │
│ category               │
│ template preview       │
└─────────────────────────┘

Template options
[Book]
[Paper]
